OL,3,GNEWSAMasterChef progress 'an incredible
OL,4,Afeeling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA promising chef who has been wowing
OL,7,Fjudges on Masterchef: The Professionals
OL,8,Fhas called it an "incredible feeling"
OL,9,Fto watch her progress back on TV.
OL,11,FAbigail Smith, 21, is starring in BBC
OL,12,FOne's ongoing series and is the demi
OL,13,Fchef de partie at The Hand and Flowers,
OL,14,Fa two Michelin-starred restaurant in
OL,15,FMarlow.
OL,17,FSmith, from Bracknell, went to
OL,18,FEdgbarrow School in Crowthorne before
OL,19,Fattending Farnborough College, where
OL,20,Fshe said she got "incredible
OL,21,Fopportunities" to hone her skills.
